        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Natrell Jamerson, Elias Soriano\n- Bands: Motown group Troop, Nonpoint\n- Songs: \"Miracle\" (Nonpoint song)\n- Albums: Nineteen Ninety-Four\n\nFacts:\n- Natrell Jamerson released the 1994 platinum-selling album Nineteen Ninety-Four.\n- Natrell Jamerson was a lead vocalist for the Motown group Troop.\n- Elias Soriano was a lead vocalist for the band Nonpoint.\n- The Nonpoint song \"Miracle\" featured Elias Soriano.",
